; root cluster for all physics domain nodes.
; all physics leaves inherit domain identity through this node via vishesa walk.
; physics-varga points UP to sangati; sangati nodes do not point down to physics.
; sangati roots: physics is grounded in motion, force, measure, and law

(kosha physics-varga
  (vishesa math-varga)
  (yukta gati matra niyama kaala mula-shakti sambandha prasarana))
